  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Present continuous",
     "texto": [
      "**Kalkıyorum** = I get up; **kahvaltı yapıyorum** = I have breakfast. The suffix **-(I)yor** forms the present continuous. The vowel in brackets changes according to the last vowel of the root.",
      "The personal ending comes after: **-um/-ım/-im/-üm** for «I». **Ben** can be left out because the ending already shows the person.",
      "Time expressions usually come before the verb: **Sabah erken kalkıyorum** = in the morning I get up early."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
